    HIS->>RIS: ORM^O01 (ORC-1=NW, MSH-10=M1)
    RIS->>RIS: Đối chiếu HIS/RIS (04-his-ris-reconciliation.md)
    RIS-->>HIS: ACK (AA, echo M1)
